    "updated_at": "2020-11-11T17:06:02Z",
    "body": "Huh. I didn't realize GH Actions automatically built targeting the newest MacOS platform (I guess if I thought about it, it would make sense).\r\n\r\nIf you're willing to spend a little extra disk space + compilation time, you can [install rustup](https://rustup.rs/), then use `cargo install starship` to get a version that works on your machine. If you can't, let us know and we'll try to think of something else.",
