    "body": "Hi @chipbuster ,\r\n\r\n🎉 I have followed your instructions and **it worked**! \r\n\r\nIt took a long time to compile the project on my machine but, after that, I just added the `eval \"$(starship init bash)\"` into my `.bash_profile` and opened a new Terminal window.\r\n\r\nI am closing this issue! Tks for the support!",
